{"5050730":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Seal & Sentence","steam_appid":5050730,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5204920],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR DECISIONS WILL REACH FAR BEYOND THE BORDER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal &amp; Sentence is a medieval document-inspection and decision-making game set at the border of a kingdom on the brink of war. Enforce royal decrees, inspect travelers’ papers, and decide who may enter the realm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every traveler is who they claim to be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INSPECT THE DOCUMENTS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare names, seals, portraits, travel permits, and kingdom records. Discover forged papers and contradictory statements. One careless mistake could allow a spy, smuggler, or wanted criminal to cross the border.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERROGATE THE SUSPICIOUS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question travelers and compare their answers with the information in their documents. Search for suspicious possessions, expose lies, and detain people when necessary. But remember: not everyone who appears suspicious is guilty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBEY THE CROWN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules at the border may change each day. Citizens of certain kingdoms may be banned, new documents may become mandatory, and arrest warrants may be issued for specific individuals. Fail to follow your orders, and you will pay the price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHOOSE BETWEEN DUTY AND CONSCIENCE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone who approaches your gate is a criminal. You will encounter families fleeing war, desperate refugees, merchants, soldiers, and strangers hiding dangerous intentions. Will you enforce the law, or do what you believe is right?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions may affect not only the outcome of the day, but also the people you encounter later and the fate of the kingdom itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspect documents, royal seals, and personal information.<br>• Interrogate suspicious travelers and search their belongings.<br>• Adapt to new rules and royal decrees each day.<br>• Respond to bribes, threats, and moral dilemmas.<br>• Follow the stories of characters who return to your checkpoint.<br>• Unlock different events and consequences through your decisions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restless line waits beyond the gate. New orders lie on your desk. Difficult decisions rest in your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp the seal. Pass the sentence.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR DECISIONS WILL REACH FAR BEYOND THE BORDER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal &amp; Sentence is a medieval document-inspection and decision-making game set at the border of a kingdom on the brink of war. Enforce royal decrees, inspect travelers’ papers, and decide who may enter the realm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every traveler is who they claim to be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INSPECT THE DOCUMENTS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare names, seals, portraits, travel permits, and kingdom records. Discover forged papers and contradictory statements. One careless mistake could allow a spy, smuggler, or wanted criminal to cross the border.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERROGATE THE SUSPICIOUS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question travelers and compare their answers with the information in their documents. Search for suspicious possessions, expose lies, and detain people when necessary. But remember: not everyone who appears suspicious is guilty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBEY THE CROWN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules at the border may change each day. Citizens of certain kingdoms may be banned, new documents may become mandatory, and arrest warrants may be issued for specific individuals. Fail to follow your orders, and you will pay the price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHOOSE BETWEEN DUTY AND CONSCIENCE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone who approaches your gate is a criminal. You will encounter families fleeing war, desperate refugees, merchants, soldiers, and strangers hiding dangerous intentions. Will you enforce the law, or do what you believe is right?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions may affect not only the outcome of the day, but also the people you encounter later and the fate of the kingdom itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspect documents, royal seals, and personal information.<br>• Interrogate suspicious travelers and search their belongings.<br>• Adapt to new rules and royal decrees each day.<br>• Respond to bribes, threats, and moral dilemmas.<br>• Follow the stories of characters who return to your checkpoint.<br>• Unlock different events and consequences through your decisions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restless line waits beyond the gate. New orders lie on your desk. Difficult decisions rest in your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp the seal. Pass the sentence.<\/p>","short_description":"Serve as a border officer in a medieval kingdom on the brink of war. Inspect documents, interrogate suspicious travelers, and decide who may enter. Will you obey the Crown or follow your conscience?","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5050730\/e80d90f88bac7385053b08e370ad3382ae32f11a\/header.jpg?t=1793662912","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5050730\/a6a6073742a77ba0371e9b1f47c072c185a53e84\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793662912","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5050730\/a6a6073742a77ba0371e9b1f47c072c185a53e84\/ca